  "solution": {
    "text": "The kinetic energy of the fragment is changed to heat. Expressing mass m in kilograms everywher, we have<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mtext>0.11</mtext></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn><msup><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8771;</mo><mtext>1.76</mtext><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></math><br /><br />Hence<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><msqrt><mtext>1.76</mtext></msqrt></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>1.32 km&#160;s</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
